1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,032
Detektor asap jenis ionisasi

2
00:00:02,052 --> 00:00:03,425
tidak mencium asap.

3
00:00:03,445 --> 00:00:05,510
Ia menjaga arus listrik kecil,

4
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:07,306
dan berbunyi saat arus itu

5
00:00:07,326 --> 00:00:07,822
melemah.

6
00:00:07,842 --> 00:00:09,340
Kuncinya ada di sebuah ruang

7
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,780
kecil berisi udara,

8
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,467
disebut ruang ionisasi.

9
00:00:12,487 --> 00:00:13,690
Di dalamnya ada dua pelat

10
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:14,897
logam yang diberi tegangan

11
00:00:14,917 --> 00:00:16,183
dari baterai.

12
00:00:16,203 --> 00:00:18,939
Di ruang itu tersegel sumber

13
00:00:18,959 --> 00:00:20,533
amerisium dua ratus empat

14
00:00:20,553 --> 00:00:21,537
puluh satu.

15
00:00:21,557 --> 00:00:22,682
Jumlahnya kurang dari satu

16
00:00:22,702 --> 00:00:24,571
mikrogram, diapit dua lapisan

17
00:00:24,591 --> 00:00:26,625
logam dan digulung tipis.

18
00:00:26,645 --> 00:00:28,096
Waktu paruhnya sekitar empat

19
00:00:28,116 --> 00:00:29,697
ratus tiga puluh dua tahun,

20
00:00:29,717 --> 00:00:31,586
jadi sumber ini tetap aktif

21
00:00:31,606 --> 00:00:33,041
sepanjang umur detektor.

22
00:00:33,061 --> 00:00:34,450
Amerisium memancarkan partikel

23
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,091
alfa.

24
00:00:35,111 --> 00:00:36,717
Partikel ini menabrak molekul

25
00:00:36,737 --> 00:00:38,311
oksigen dan nitrogen di udara,

26
00:00:38,331 --> 00:00:39,596
lalu merebut elektronnya.

27
00:00:39,616 --> 00:00:40,741
Udara di ruang itu berubah

28
00:00:40,761 --> 00:00:41,938
menjadi ion bermuatan.

29
00:00:41,958 --> 00:00:44,103
Ion positif dan ion negatif

30
00:00:44,123 --> 00:00:45,001
ditarik ke pelat yang

31
00:00:45,021 --> 00:00:46,053
berlawanan.

32
00:00:46,073 --> 00:00:47,400
Hasilnya arus listrik kecil

33
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,623
yang mengalir terus,

34
00:00:48,643 --> 00:00:49,693
siang dan malam.

35
00:00:49,713 --> 00:00:51,009
Saat asap masuk,

36
00:00:51,029 --> 00:00:52,154
partikel asap menyerap

37
00:00:52,174 --> 00:00:53,625
partikel alfa dan mengikat

38
00:00:53,645 --> 00:00:54,517
ion.

39
00:00:54,537 --> 00:00:55,756
Arus pun turun.

40
00:00:55,776 --> 00:00:57,320
Rangkaian elektronik membaca

41
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:58,280
penurunan itu,

42
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,195
lalu alarm berbunyi.

43
00:01:00,215 --> 00:01:02,097
Lalu, amankah?

44
00:01:02,117 --> 00:01:03,738
Partikel alfa hanya mampu

45
00:01:03,758 --> 00:01:05,426
menempuh beberapa sentimeter

46
00:01:05,446 --> 00:01:06,138
di udara,

47
00:01:06,158 --> 00:01:07,221
dan tertahan di dalam

48
00:01:07,241 --> 00:01:07,980
detektor.

49
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,203
Menurut regulator nuklir

50
00:01:09,223 --> 00:01:11,055
Amerika, dosis setahun dari

51
00:01:11,075 --> 00:01:12,649
dua detektor setara radiasi

52
00:01:12,669 --> 00:01:13,903
alam yang kamu terima dalam

53
00:01:13,923 --> 00:01:15,206
sekitar dua belas jam.

54
00:01:15,226 --> 00:01:17,977
Jadi biarkan detektormu tetap

55
00:01:17,997 --> 00:01:19,861
utuh dan terpasang.

56
00:01:19,881 --> 00:01:22,756
Ini AUDIRA,

57
00:01:22,776 --> 00:01:24,396
Cara Kerja Benda.

58
00:01:24,416 --> 00:01:25,639
Episode berikutnya:

59
00:01:25,659 --> 00:01:27,622
kabel internet bawah laut.

